      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Built: capture, hooks (Lightning, YOLO), forwarders, log_eval, the eval engine, baselines, compare and gate. Forwarders run on their own threads and never block step 2. Logged events: run_started, hook_attached, metrics_flushed, eval_completed, compare_completed or compare_refused, gate_passed or gate_failed, run_finished.",
